      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALABAMA FOX (3) progressive mare who looks set for a big campaign. Drifted in betting on resumption before running on late to finish a narrow second over 1300m at Warwick Farm in a fast-run contest. Lloyd sticks from the rails draw and has excellent second-up credentials. Can stamp her authority today. MALUKU (5) is building a solid winning CV with the three wins from her four starts. Kept fresh when she pounced on them late to salute after settling midfield over 1200m at Warwick Farm in easier grade. Ready for this trip and gets a better set-up. BESIDE THE OCEAN (2) handy mare who finds an easier contest fourth up. Not that far away from the wide gate when a close up fifth to Silvanito in BM78 class over 1500m at Rosehill. Look for her late. SUPERFABULISTIC (6) improving mare resuming. Ploughed through the heavy going to salute again over 1600m at Warwick Farm in BM72 company last May. Given the two trials and sure to be around the money.",
